50:06.823 --> 50:12.293
I had an interview
at Dean Witter for an internship...

50:12.495 --> 50:13.955
...and I got it.

50:14.164 --> 50:16.714
So I'm gonna stand out
in my programme.

50:18.418 --> 50:20.498
Salesman to intern's backwards.

50:20.754 --> 50:22.634
