50:24.841 --> 50:26.471
I gotta go.

51:00.043 --> 51:02.423
Tell him I love him, okay?

51:03.046 --> 51:04.666
<i>And...</i>

51:10.637 --> 51:12.927
I know you'll take care of him, Chris.

51:13.139 --> 51:14.849
I know that.

51:56.433 --> 51:59.193
- <i>Dean Witter.</i>
- Yes, hi.

51:59.519 --> 52:03.229
Yes, I'd like to leave a message
for Mr. Jay Twistle.

52:03.440 --> 52:06.990
- <i>Your name?</i>
- Yeah, my name is Chris Gardner.

52:07.193 --> 52:08.323
The message is:

52:08.528 --> 52:14.198
Thank you very much
for inviting me into the programme.

52:14.451 --> 52:20.251
I really appreciate it and I'd be
very pleased to accept your invitation.

52:20.457 --> 52:22.327
<i>Is that all?</i>

52:22.626 --> 52:24.166
Yes, that's it.

52:24.377 --> 52:26.127
- <i>Okay.</i>
- Thank you.

52:26.379 --> 52:27.919
<i>Bye.</i>

52:54.491 --> 52:55.781
