- Yep.

53:38.868 --> 53:41.408
- Hey, you know what today is?
- Yeah.

53:41.621 --> 53:43.291
- What?
- Saturday.

53:43.540 --> 53:45.790
- You know what Saturday is, right?
- Yeah.

53:46.042 --> 53:48.422
- What?
- Basketball.

53:48.628 --> 53:51.508
- You wanna go play some basketball?
- Okay.

53:51.715 --> 53:54.295
All right, then we're gonna go
sell a bone-density scanner.

53:54.551 --> 53:58.761
- How about that? Wanna do that?
- No.

53:59.973 --> 54:02.353
Hey, Dad. I'm going pro.

54:04.060 --> 54:06.020
I'm going pro.

54:07.314 --> 54:08.694
Okay.

54:08.899 --> 54:11.689
Yeah, I don't know, you know.

54:12.402 --> 54:14.652
You'll probably be about as good
as I was.

54:14.905 --> 54:17.945
That's kind of the way it works,
you know. I was below average.

54:18.325 --> 54:21.945
You know, so you'll probably
ultimately rank...

54:22.162 --> 54:24.792
...somewhere around there,
you know, so...

54:24.998 --> 54:27.878
