- I gotta go to work.

1:01:14.157 --> 1:01:17.867
Hey, you just got hit by a car.
Go to the hospital.

1:01:18.245 --> 1:01:21.745
I'm in a competitive internship
at Dean Witter.

1:01:32.342 --> 1:01:33.972
Hey, man, you're missing a shoe.

1:01:34.177 --> 1:01:38.267
Oh, yeah, thanks. Thank you.

1:01:44.104 --> 1:01:45.484
Dad.

1:01:46.022 --> 1:01:49.032
- You don't have a shoe.
- Yeah, I know.

1:01:49.276 --> 1:01:52.316
- Wanna know what happened?
- Yeah.

1:01:53.029 --> 1:01:54.529
I got hit by a car.

1:01:54.781 --> 1:01:57.451
- You got hit by a car?
- Yep.

1:01:57.617 --> 1:02:01.247
