- Like, the back of my legs.

1:02:04.708 --> 1:02:06.538
- Hey, goodbye, Mrs. Chu.
- Goodbye.

1:02:06.793 --> 1:02:09.923
- Were you on the street?
- Yeah, I was running in the street.

1:02:10.130 --> 1:02:13.010
Don't do that. You can get hurt.

1:02:13.383 --> 1:02:15.223
Yeah, thanks.

1:02:15.468 --> 1:02:17.178
I'll remember that next time.

1:02:19.472 --> 1:02:20.852
<i>And here I was again.</i>

1:02:21.057 --> 1:02:23.687
- <i>Show up early.</i>
- While qualified persons...

1:02:23.977 --> 1:02:27.807
