1:02:41.912 --> 1:02:44.752
Okay, next time.
All right, I'm gonna hold you to that.

1:02:44.998 --> 1:02:46.288
Okay, yes, thank you.

1:02:46.499 --> 1:02:47.879
Who wants to get me a doughnut?

1:02:48.084 --> 1:02:51.804
- Chris?
- Yes, sir.

1:02:53.173 --> 1:02:56.343
<i>Feeling underrated</i>
