1:07:54.558 --> 1:07:55.728
- Hi.
- Hi.

1:07:55.976 --> 1:07:58.516
I'm Chris Gardner. I have
an appointment with Mr. Ribbon.

1:07:58.728 --> 1:08:00.148
Oh, you just missed him.

1:08:02.732 --> 1:08:04.282
Thank you.

1:08:28.425 --> 1:08:32.255
